---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Aplica DS — how we collect, use, and protect your data."
  lang="en"
>
  <main style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">Last updated: May 18, 2026</p>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        Aplica DS is an open-source design token system developed and maintained by Poe Bellentani.
        For questions related to privacy and data processing, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:privacy@aplica.me" style="color: var(--color-accent);">privacy@aplica.me</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">2. Data we collect</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">We collect data only in the situations described below:</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2.1 Analytics (with your consent only)</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        With your permission, we use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how the site is used.
        Data collected includes: anonymous session identifier, pages visited, session duration,
        device type, and country of origin (IP address anonymized). No personally identifiable
        data is collected through analytics.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2.2 Scheduling (/pro page)</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        When you book a session on the <a href="/en/pro" style="color: var(--color-accent);">/pro</a> page,
        you use the Calendly service, which collects your name and email address for scheduling purposes.
        Calendly is an independent data processor subject to its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2.3 Local preferences (never sent to servers)</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        We store your theme (light/dark) and language preferences locally in your browser via
        <code>localStorage</code>. This data is never transmitted to any server and remains
        exclusively on your device. It is not considered personal data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">3. Legal basis</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        Analytics data processing is carried out on the basis of your explicit consent
        (LGPD, art. 7°, I; GDPR, art. 6(1)(a)). You may withdraw this consent at any time
        by clicking "Cookie preferences" in the site footer. Data processed via Calendly
        occurs only when you voluntarily initiate a booking and is governed by Calendly's terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">4. Data processors</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">We use the following third-party services that may process data on our behalf:</p>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 2;">
        <li><strong>Google LLC (Google Analytics 4)</strong> — site usage analytics with anonymized IP and 14-month data retention.</li>
        <li><strong>Calendly Inc.</strong> — session scheduling on the /pro page; collects user name and email.</li>
        <li><strong>Google LLC (Google Fonts CDN)</strong> — typographic font loading; your IP address may be exposed to Google's servers when the page loads.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">5. Retention periods</h2>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 2;">
        <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> analytics data retained for 14 months (GA4 default setting).</li>
        <li><strong>Calendly:</strong> per Calendly Inc.'s own retention policy.</li>
        <li><strong>Local preferences:</strong> remain in your browser until you clear browser data or revoke consent on this site.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">6. Your rights</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Under the LGPD (Brazilian Law No. 13,709/2018) and the GDPR, you have the right to:
      </p>
      <ul style="list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 2;">
        <li>Confirm whether your data is being processed</li>
        <li>Access the data we hold about you</li>
        <li>Correct incomplete, inaccurate, or outdated data</li>
        <li>Request deletion of data processed on the basis of consent</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        <li>Data portability, where applicable</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">7. How to exercise your rights</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        To exercise any of the rights above, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:privacy@aplica.me" style="color: var(--color-accent);">privacy@aplica.me</a>.
        We will respond within 15 business days.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">8. How to change your cookie preferences</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        You can change your cookie preferences at any time by clicking
        <button
          onclick="try{localStorage.removeItem('aplica-consent');document.getElementById('aplica-cookie-banner').style.display='flex';}catch(e){}"
          style="background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; color: var(--color-accent); font-size: inherit; padding: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-family: inherit;"
        >Cookie preferences</button>
        in the site footer. This will remove your stored consent and display the banner again.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 1rem;">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p style="line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-text-muted);">
        This policy may be updated to reflect changes in our data practices or legal obligations.
        The date of the last update is always shown at the top of this page.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>
